  "Wood Polymer Composite — entenda a composição da madeira ecológica Lesco e como ela se aplica nas linhas Brise, Shield, Deck, Panel e Line.": "Wood Polymer Composite — understand the composition of Lesco's eco-friendly wood and how it is applied across the Brise, Shield, Deck, Panel and Line collections.",
